{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946880/extras/0db89f7fbde7797c13618e7eb4c0e1b3.poster.avif?t=1759010322\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946880/extras/0db89f7fbde7797c13618e7eb4c0e1b3.webm?t=1759010322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946880/extras/a1514f63721c6b8714c04f2d1a7a4b90.avif?t=1759010322\" width=1560 height=485 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up stranded on a small patch of land, surrounded by endless ocean. With only basic tools and limited resources, your survival depends on your ability to adapt, create, and expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop down trees, mine stone, and collect resources from the sea. Craft soil to expand your island, build machines to automate production, and research technologies to unlock powerful upgrades. Over time, your primitive, fuel-powered equipment will evolve into advanced electrical systems capable of running an entire settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But progress comes at a cost. You\u2019ll need to balance food, fuel, and production chains to keep everything running smoothly. The environment is alive shifting weather and a day-night cycle will test your adaptability at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey has no set path. Will you create a peaceful, self-sustaining haven\u2026 or push technology to its limits? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946880/extras/4f948cc4544aa3442ee069bd9ed146ad.avif?t=1759010322\" width=225 height=127 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Island</strong> \u2013 Produce soil and claim new territory tile by tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate Production</strong> \u2013 Use machines to harvest resources from both land and sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Elements</strong> \u2013 Manage hunger, fuel, and resources while adapting to changing weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advance Through Technology</strong> \u2013 Progress from basic tools to complex, automated systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World</strong> \u2013 Experience immersive day-night cycles and weather effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-Ended Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No scripted path \u2014 build, survive, and expand at your own pace.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946880?t=1759010322","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946880?t=1759010322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946880/575dc0d99f836d09343a9418515ecd82c9e051ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759010322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946880/575dc0d99f836d09343a9418515ecd82c9e051ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759010322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=