ragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Island</strong> \u2013 Produce soil and claim new territory tile by tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate Production</strong> \u2013 Use machines to harvest resources from both land and sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Elements</strong> \u2013 Manage hunger, fuel, and resources while adapting to changing weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advance Through Technology</strong> \u2013 Progress from basic tools to complex, automated systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World</strong> \u2013 Experience immersive day-night cycles and weather effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-Ended Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No scripted path \u2014 build, survive, and expand at your own pace.</p></li></ul>","developers":["IS Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946880/b3904b01621b92c8047bab4799a497f53e5eb788/header.jpg?t=1759010322","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946880/1957557238/690c3d65c57965de9c97a2a45f649a1ea8662b2c/1754862711/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755074124","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946880/1957557238/690c3d65c57965de9c97a2a45f649a1ea8662b2c/1754862711/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755074124","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946880/1957557238/690c3d65c57965de9c97a2a45f649a1ea8662b2c/1754862711/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755074124","id":257181222,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181222/movie480.mp4?t=1755074124","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181222/movie_max.mp4?t=1755074124"},"name":"Survindust","thumbnail":"https://shar